        "answer": {
          "short": "$x\\equiv2\\pmod4$.",
          "worked": "The multiplicative inverse of 3 modulo 4 is 3.\n$$\\begin{align*}3x+1&\\equiv3\\pmod4\\\\3x&\\equiv2\\pmod4\\\\3\\cdot3x&\\equiv3\\cdot2\\pmod4\\\\x&\\equiv6\\pmod4\\\\x&\\equiv2\\pmod4\\end{align*}$$",
